: "1885834442416011", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_1885834452416010_4428855872500101110_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bdx9cAeVG9UQ7kNvwE8myv5&_nc_oc=AdpRLmz9ygq6NtzWzpPVaGeY_dCn5-9_wM0y-26gNxjJ2waZuA8Yp1qXi1Lw-_q4mjo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTHVTsQyeJNXcvMT5n2JX5bR-m7uXQJ8fOBeIDpt8BhVw&oe=6AF35134"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_thumbnail_2560x1440.png", "id": "1640841670930601", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_1640841677597267_8842512154514944922_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DBWDcHjUf4QQ7kNvwFuH3BJ&_nc_oc=AdpBFMREXQ-fFvgNGtZTYnJlNRvdr36z5SCEEq9dCYFpC4BPfEcbbUOt6is7n1PsZkc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhZdWnWxluNG1x9sszQ2FkxUMWImIOeaqL8DTitIHjbQ&oe=6AF34267"}, "display_name": "Derelict", "keywords": ["scifi", "shooter", "roguelike", "robots", "fps"], "long_description": "**The station lays itself out again every run. The machines are still there.**\n\n# \u2622\ufe0f Three decks\n\nReactor, Cryo Bay, Greenhouse. Up to 152 metres a side, 7 to 29 rooms.\n\n# \ud83d\udd2b Four guns in your hands\n\n- **Pulse Pistol** - eighteen metres, twelve rounds\n- **Heavy Revolver** - 45 a shot at twenty-three metres\n- **Assault Rifle** - thirty rounds, two hands, automatic\n- **Stutterer** - thirty-five rounds, shortest reach\n\nA ring on the floor is your weapon's reach. Past its edge nothing lands.\n\n{1400039901593188}\n\n# \ud83e\udd16 Four machines, all shooting back\n\n- **Trilobite** - fast, closes to ten metres\n- **Eye Drone** - hovers at chest height\n- **Quad Shell** - 160 health and plating\n- **Servitor** - bursts from seventeen metres\n\nEach winds up before firing, with a weak point worth 2.5 body shots.\n\n{1729025084985916}\n\n# \ud83d\udc80 The Warden of the Deep\n\n900 health, three phases, and it calls for help.\n\n# \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 25 upgrade levels\n\nGuns, tuning, plating, frame, medkits. Four artifacts drop from the dead: speed, damage, armour, repairs.\n\n{1607434177728724}\n\n# \u2699\ufe0f Three difficulties, 17 comfort settings\n\nDifficulty changes how many machines a deck holds, their health and damage, how far off they notice you, and what a kill pays. Hard fills every planned spot - up to 48 - and pays 60 per cent more.\n\nSnap or smooth turning, vignette, seated play, dominant hand, haptics. The camera is never moved for you.", "short_description": "\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f A first-person VR roguelike shooter. Four guns you hold in your own hands, a derelict station that lays its decks out fresh every run, and the Warden of the Deep at the end of each one. Three decks \u2014 \u2622\ufe0f reactor, \u2744\ufe0f cryo bay, \ud83c\udf3f greenhouse \u2014 up to 29 rooms across 152 metres, and up to 48 machines that shoot back from as far as seventeen metres. Die and a quarter of what you gathered stays on the deck. Walk out mid-run and you carry nothing."}]}, "developer_name": "MasterVRMaze", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://derelict-58a4bd.gitlab.io/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "idansun228", "support_website_url": "https://derelict-58a4bd.gitlab.io/support.html", "website_url": "https://derelict-58a4bd.gitlab.io/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "860942427048960"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1787877139140730"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1395913706064294"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1395913706064294"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1787877139140730"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "876703648806171", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "2658121527939794", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "860942417048961", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "876703648806171"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2658121527939794"}]}, "change_log": "First release.\r\n\r\nFour guns, three decks, and the Warden of the Deep at the end of each one.\r\nEvery run lays the station out fresh: up to 29 rooms across 152 metres, up\r\nto 48 machines that shoot back. Die and a quarter of what you gathered stays\r\non the deck; walk out mid-run and you carry nothing.\r\n\r\nBuilt for Quest 3. Seated and standing both supported, with height calibration\r\nin the settings.", "created_date": 1789959426, "id": "876703648806171", "version": "1.0.0", "version_code": 126, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}